# Per-pod runtime state written by cloud/pod.sh: the run name `arm` records for
# `status`/`rung` to read, the provision transcript, and the launch client's
# transcript. Keyed by vast id, so they accumulate one set per pod ever rented
# and describe a machine that no longer exists the moment it is destroyed.
cloud/.last-run-*
cloud/.last-provision-*.log
cloud/.last-launch-*.log
